          "detail": "调用 bge-m3 embeddings API。",
          "command": "curl https://cloud.infini-ai.com/maas/v1/embeddings -H 'Authorization: Bearer ${INFINIAI_API_KEY}' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"model\":\"bge-m3\",\"input\":[\"hello world\"]}'",
          "expected": "返回 embedding vector。"
        },
        {
          "title": "Rerank",
          "detail": "调用 bge-reranker-v2-m3 rerank API。",
          "command": "curl https://cloud.infini-ai.com/maas/v1/rerank -H 'Authorization: Bearer ${INFINIAI_API_KEY}' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"model\":\"bge-reranker-v2-m3\",\"query\":\"apple\",\"documents\":[\"apple\",\"banana\"]}'",
          "expected": "返回文档相关性排序。"
        },
        {
          "title": "复核价格",
